  unitName: Samurai Mifune
  unitId: 60022
  unitNumber: 41
  description: An other-worldly samurai that appeared in the ruined Bariura Empire.
    He fought in many famous duels with his special katana.Rumors spread around Grand
    Gaia and many swordsmen challenged him. His beloved katana awakened its true
    power during those fights. It was a demonic blade that lusted for human blood.
    Unable to restrain himself, he gave in to its power.
  summonDesc: You knew I use a demon blade?<br>Then let me share with you <br>the
    secret to its power!
  fusionDesc: A katana relies not just on<br>strength but also on spirit.<br>I must
    train both body and mind!
  evoDesc: I walk the blood-drenched <br>path of a samurai.<br>Is that alright with
    you?
  element: 6
  rarity: 2
